OL,3,GNEWSAThe hero dinner lady who died
OL,4,Ashielding five children in the Aberfan
OL,5,Adisaster
OL,6,
OL,7,FWithin moments, 144 people were dead,
OL,8,Fincluding 116 children, on what was the
OL,9,Flast day of school before the half-term
OL,10,Fholiday.
